WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.369 --> 00:00:23.058
<v><b>A:</b></v> What would you like (Izzy)? Your usual?

2
00:00:23.229 --> 00:00:24.787
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, please.

3
00:00:33.727 --> 00:00:35.057
<v><b>A:</b></v> How’s the job?

4
00:00:35.361 --> 00:00:38.686
<v><b>B:</b></v> Good! It’s long hours, but I like it.

5
00:00:48.073 --> 00:00:49.802
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you two friends?

6
00:00:50.809 --> 00:00:53.925
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes. I come here a lot.

7
00:01:02.894 --> 00:01:04.547
<v><b>A:</b></v> I live very near here.

8
00:01:05.421 --> 00:01:06.276
<v><b>B:</b></v> Really?

9
00:01:16.347 --> 00:01:18.171
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you want to go out sometime?

10
00:01:18.361 --> 00:01:20.394
<v><b>B:</b></v> Me? Yes.